        "content": "LiteLLM's Prometheus metric names change between minor releases. An empty panel is ambiguous - it does not distinguish \"no traffic\" from \"the metric was renamed\". Check with:\n\n`curl -s http://gateway.nullnode.localhost:8080/metrics | grep litellm_`"
